---@field MessageType? aws.config_service.MessageType|string The type of notification that triggers Config to run an evaluation for a rule. You can specify the following notification types:
---@field MaximumExecutionFrequency? aws.config_service.MaximumExecutionFrequency|string The frequency at which you want Config to run evaluations for a custom rule with a periodic trigger. If you specify a value for MaximumExecutionFrequency, then MessageType must use the ScheduledNotification value.

