---Amazon Web Services Systems Manager (SSM) specific remediation controls.
---@class aws.config_service.SsmControls
---@field ConcurrentExecutionRatePercentage? aws.config_service.Percentage The maximum percentage of remediation actions allowed to run in parallel on the non-compliant resources for that specific rule. You can specify a percentage, such as 10%. The default value is 10.
---@field ErrorPercentage? aws.config_service.Percentage The percentage of errors that are allowed before SSM stops running automations on non-compliant resources for that specific rule. You can specify a percentage of errors, for example 10%. If you do not specifiy a percentage, the default is 50%. For example, if you set the ErrorPercentage to 40% for 10 non-compliant resources, then SSM stops running the automations when the fifth error is received.

